 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0
+
+- Orders take a discount code: `SPRING10` (10 % off the items) or `WELCOME5` (5.00 € off items of 30.00 € or more).
+  Order totals show `discountCents`.
+- Approved by Dana Okafor <dana.okafor@lanternlane.example>: the discount codes behave as asked, release them
+  (verdict relayed to the developer in the request; 2026-10-30).
+
 ## 1.4.0
 
 - Orders keep the date they were placed on.
