 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+
+Discount codes: `orders.applyCode(number, code)` gives an order `SPRING10` (10 % off the items, half a cent rounds up)
+or `WELCOME5` (5.00 € off items of 30.00 € or more). An order has one code at most; a new one replaces the old. Shipping
+is never discounted, and free shipping is still decided on the items before the discount. `totals` shows `discountCents`.
